    REFACTOR-0004: MyWrapped takes its sources instead of creating them
    
    MyWrapped's constructor took one export per platform and wrapped each
    in its adapter, so adding a platform meant a new constructor parameter
    and a change to MyWrapped. It now takes a MusicSource[] and never names
    a platform.
    
    index.ts still reads each export, and now hands it to that platform's
    adapter itself. It is the one place that picks the platforms.

